      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-01T13:52:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ammo drop lets you draw during Turret Mode because it specifically says so on the card. &nbsp;Not being able to draw cards is a blanket restriction, not just on your phase. &nbsp;It would be be the same with card like Feelt of Foot, Bolster Allies, etc: &nbsp;Bunker would not be able to draw from those in Turret Mode</p>",
